=\"#type-t.live\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>live : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <a href=\"#type-entry\">entry</a></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Queue.t</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Oldest first.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-create\"><a href=\"#val-create\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> create : <span><span class=\"label\">capacity</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">align</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-rounded\"><a href=\"#val-rounded\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> rounded : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-reclaim\"><a href=\"#val-reclaim\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> reclaim : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">is_done</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">on_free</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fits\"><a href=\"#val-fits\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fits : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-reserve\"><a href=\"#val-reserve\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> reserve : \u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">is_done</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">wait</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">on_free</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Offset of a free range of <code>size</code> bytes (rounded up to the alignment). Reclaims completed allocations first; when the request still does not fit, calls <code>wait</code> on the oldest live fence (which must complete it), hands it to <code>on_free</code>, and retries. Raises <code>Invalid_argument</code> when <code>size</code> exceeds the capacity or is not positive. The range is NOT reserved until <a href=\"#val-commit\"><code>commit</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-commit\"><a href=\"#val-commit\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> commit : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">off</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Mark the <code>size</code> bytes at <code>off</code> live until <code>fence</code> completes. <code>off</code> must come from the <a href=\"#val-reserve\"><code>reserve</code></a> immediately before, with the same <code>size</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-live_count\"><a href=\"#val-live_count\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> live_count : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'fence</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Number of allocations whose fence has not been handed back.</p></div></div>"}